const SP_STEPS = [['Pick the right businesses', 'Start with businesses whose customers are your community, past supporters, and businesses near your building. A local car dealer, pharmacy, estate agent or restaurant is often a better bet than a big chain.'], ['Find the right person', 'Ask who looks after community support or marketing. In small businesses it’s usually the owner. Get a name before you send anything.'], ['Think about timing', 'Many businesses set budgets at the start of the year or financial year (April). Avoid their busiest weeks. Ask early for Ramadan, Eid, Christmas and back-to-school projects: two to three months ahead is good.'], ['Make the first contact short', 'A short, personal email or a visit. Say who you are, what the project is, who it helps, and one clear ask. Offer to send a one-page outline.'], ['Follow up once', 'If you don’t hear back in a week or so, one friendly follow-up is fine. Then leave it and try again next season.'], ['Meet and listen', 'Ask what matters to them: their customers, staff, reputation. Shape your offer around that, and agree what they get in writing.'], ['Deliver and report back', 'Do everything you promised. Send photos, numbers and a thank-you. A sponsor who feels appreciated comes back next year.']];
